{"title":"Wraith","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 29 Ghost that attacks with freeze (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\">Special: drainFrac: .35</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/soul-shard\">Soul Shard</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/wraith\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/wraith?lv=29\">Lv 29</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/wraith?lv=30\">Lv 30 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/wraith?lv=31\">Lv 31 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/wraith?lv=32\">Lv 32 <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/wraith?lv=33\">Lv 33 <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/wraith?lv=34\">Lv 34 <span>7</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/wraith?lv=35\">Lv 35 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/wraith?lv=29\" title=\"Pick level 29\"><td><b>29</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>111</td><td>20.5</td><td>1,450</td><td class=\"muted\">333 · 28.7 · 4,350</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/wraith?lv=30\" title=\"Pick level 30\"><td><b>30</b></td><td>118</td><td>21</td><td>1,500</td><td class=\"muted\">354 · 29.4 · 4,500</td><td>3</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/wraith?lv=31\" title=\"Pick level 31\"><td><b>31</b></td><td>124</td><td>21.6</td><td>1,550</td><td class=\"muted\">372 · 30.2 · 4,650</td><td>3</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/wraith?lv=32\" title=\"Pick level 32\"><td><b>32</b></td><td>131</td><td>22.1</td><td>1,600</td><td class=\"muted\">393 · 30.9 · 4,800</td><td>4</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/wraith?lv=33\" title=\"Pick level 33\"><td><b>33</b></td><td>137</td><td>22.7</td><td>1,650</td><td class=\"muted\">411 · 31.8 · 4,950</td><td>4</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/wraith\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>34</b></td><td>145</td><td>23.2</td><td>1,700</td><td class=\"muted\">435 · 32.5 · 5,100</td><td>7</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/wraith?lv=35\" title=\"Pick level 35\"><td><b>35</b></td><td>152</td><td>23.8</td><td>1,750</td><td class=\"muted\">456 · 33.3 · 5,250</td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 9 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 9 looted corpses, 28 recorded drops, 1,429 total, 17–163 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/9</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"ectoplasm\" title=\"Ectoplasm - in 44% of 9 looted corpses, 4 recorded drops, 4 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/c92b6e71974b03c38adf.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ectoplasm</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">44% · 4/9</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"spirit-essence\" title=\"Spirit Essence - in 33% of 9 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 3 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/8875c6f441ed9a66c7ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Spirit Essence</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">33% · 3/9</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"werewolfpelt-head\" title=\"Werewolfpelt Head - in 11% of 9 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/69bc975155db9bef5f6d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Werewolfpelt Head</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">11% · 1/9</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Superior: 1 of 1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+2 more\">+2 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"black-walnut-crossbow\" title=\"Black Walnut Crossbow - in 11% of 9 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/9eb6bfca42dff868e02b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Black Walnut Crossbow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">11% · 1/9</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"health-potion-large\" title=\"Health Potion Large - in 11% of 9 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/752437a6ecea30afa5ec.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Health Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">11% · 1/9</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Wraithhollow</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 22</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-200\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/morvaine-the-pale\"><img src=\"data/img/438f80cd8cbb7758478d.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Morvaine the Pale</b><span>Lv 35</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Ghost: <a href=\"#/monster/shade\">Shade</a> <span class=\"muted\">(23)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/banshee\">Banshee</a> <span class=\"muted\">(35)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/aeaf0aa4188ec64745fd.webp\" alt=\"Wraith\"></div><h3>Wraith</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>34</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 29)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Ghost</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>freeze · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>145</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>23.2</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1,700</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.6 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <t